    <briefdescription>
<para>Used to describe addressing mode similar to <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_ext_addr_mode" kindref="compound">ExtAddrMode</ref> in CodeGenPrepare. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It holds the register values, the scale value and the displacement. It also holds a descriptor for the expression used to calculate the address from the operands. </para>
